This repository contains files under several licenses.

Each file carries an SPDX-License-Identifier header, and REUSE.toml assigns a
license to files that cannot carry one. The full license texts are in
LICENSES/:

  LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt   kernel patches, kernel modules
  LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause.txt   device tree fragments
  LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt   dual-licensed kernel headers in overlay/include/
  LICENSES/MIT.txt            scripts, hooks, packaging, documentation
  (GPL-2.0.txt and the dual licenses cover the unmodified kernel headers
  in overlay/include/)

Third-party files keep their original license and copyright notices.

No firmware, BIOS images, ACPI tables or Windows drivers are distributed here.
